ve would be printed as\n \"ws_test_network.1\"; if the mask length above had been 16 rather than 24, the\n-printed address would be ``ws_test_network.0.1\".\n+printed address would be \"ws_test_network.0.1\".\n \n =item Name Resolution (ethers)\n \n",
